## A single image

![A placeholder illustration](../../assets/writing/example-wide.svg "A placeholder illustration, with an optional caption underneath.")

Images keep their aspect ratio and flow 10% past the text column on each side, while the caption stays on the column.

## Two columns

{% columns %}
{% column %}
The left column holds a short block of text. It sits beside the right column on wide screens and stacks above it on small ones.
{% /column %}
